1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,502
This foil triangle flies.

2
00:00:02,542 --> 00:00:04,377
Nothing on it moves.

3
00:00:04,417 --> 00:00:07,335
No wings. No rotor. No fuel.

4
00:00:07,375 --> 00:00:09,585
So is it antigravity?

5
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:11,602
Take it apart.

6
00:00:11,917 --> 00:00:14,960
1928 · British patent 300,311

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,085
For "producing force or motion."

8
00:00:18,125 --> 00:00:21,252
Its holder: Thomas Townsend Brown.

9
00:00:21,292 --> 00:00:23,085
Three parts.

10
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:26,043
Thin wire. Air gap. Foil skirt.

11
00:00:26,083 --> 00:00:29,377
About 30,000 volts go across them.

12
00:00:29,417 --> 00:00:32,585
The sharp wire's field ionises the air.

13
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:35,918
Ions race to the foil, bumping into air.

14
00:00:35,958 --> 00:00:39,002
Each bump passes on a push. A wind.

15
00:00:39,042 --> 00:00:42,377
Wind goes down. The lifter goes up.

16
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:45,168
The missing fourth part is the air.

17
00:00:45,208 --> 00:00:48,335
Not antigravity. Ion wind.

18
00:00:48,375 --> 00:00:50,960
A real plane has flown on it.

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,849
2018. No moving parts. A gym: about 60 m.

20
00:00:57,125 --> 00:00:59,793
STILLWING asks: what if you stacked them?

21
00:00:59,833 --> 00:01:03,002
Cells into a tile. Tiles into a wing.

22
00:01:03,042 --> 00:01:06,835
Wire 0.1 mm. Air gap 30 mm.

23
00:01:06,875 --> 00:01:10,793
30 kV per cell. 0 moving parts.

24
00:01:10,833 --> 00:01:14,710
Trial 1: one foil cell lifts its own 3 g.

25
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:18,085
60 s on a tether. Flew.

26
00:01:18,125 --> 00:01:21,918
Trial 2: 64 cells carry 2 kg.

27
00:01:21,958 --> 00:01:25,002
4 min at 2 m. Flew.

28
00:01:25,042 --> 00:01:28,627
Trial 3: 1,200 cells. A full wing.

29
00:01:28,667 --> 00:01:33,711
Wing: 12 km, own batteries. Silent.

30
00:01:33,875 --> 00:01:35,668
One catch.

31
00:01:35,708 --> 00:01:37,502
It pushes on air.

32
00:01:37,542 --> 00:01:40,918
Up high the air thins. So does thrust.

33
00:01:40,958 --> 00:01:43,668
It stalls out at 3 km.

34
00:01:43,708 --> 00:01:46,598
In the vacuum chamber: 0.

35
00:01:46,917 --> 00:01:48,752
STILLWING is cleared.

36
00:01:48,792 --> 00:01:50,877
Below 3 km.

37
00:01:50,917 --> 00:01:53,335
Not as antigravity.

38
00:01:53,375 --> 00:01:56,085
Just wire, foil and air.

39
00:01:56,125 --> 00:01:59,921
Case closed. Next file opens Sunday.
